    isbefore: []  # 7716
    duplicate_of: []  # 7716
    not_duplicate_of: []  # 7716
    pr_ref:  # 7716
    description: "FOUND 2026-10-13 while fixing INV-tazur (PR #1567). The Woodpecker per-PR `pytest` step (.woodpecker/woodpecker.yml) now refuses a manifest naming a missing test and names pytest exit 5 as a zero-collect failure. It still passes a run in which every collected test SKIPPED: pytest exits 0 and the step has no count of executed tests (no --junit-xml, no result-line check). smart-test locally treats that case as ZERO TESTS EXECUTED (exit 5), so local and CI verdicts disagree on it. Not reproduced in CI; derived from reading the step. Fix sketch: pass --junit-xml to the step's pytest and fail when no testcase executed (xfail counts as executed), with a positive control in tests/test_ci_pytest_selection_gate.py. The dormant GitHub ci.yml pytest job has the same shape and was not changed."  # 7716
    fields:  # 7716
      statement: "The per-PR CI pytest step never passes a run that executed zero tests"  # 7716
      root_cause: "the step trusts pytest's exit code alone; all-skipped exits 0 and the step counts no executed tests"  # 7716
- op: discuss  # 9632
  at: '2026-10-29T07:46:16Z'  # 9632
  by: agent  # 9632
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 9632
  clock: 2  # 9632
  nonce: '9632'  # 9632
  message: "PREMISE CHECK 2026-10-29 (dev 4892851370). VERDICT: CURRENT; still violated, now reproduced behaviorally, not only read. The pytest step's manifest block was extracted from .woodpecker/woodpecker.yml and executed by tests/test_ci_pytest_selection_gate.py's own _sandbox/_run harness (real block, replaced PATH), with a stub pytest that prints a real all-skipped result line ('1 skipped in 0.01s') and exits 0, which is pytest's status for an all-skipped run (smart-test's own comment at scripts/smart-test:543 states the same). Result: pytest invoked, step exit 0 -- passed. The block still checks only TEST_EXIT == 5 (woodpecker.yml ~:623) and has no executed-test count (no --junit-xml, no result-line check). The dormant .github/workflows/ci.yml still exists with the same shape (not re-read in detail). Title, statement, root_cause and fix sketch stand. Proposed to the owner: P3 -> P2 (a per-PR gate that cannot fail on this input)."  # 9632
